        <div class="setup-step">
          <div class="step-number">09</div>
          <div class="step-body">
            <h3>Attach chart screenshots</h3>
            <p>Use Notion's embed block or image upload inside each trade row for <strong>entry and exit charts</strong>. Being able to revisit your screenshot context later is one of the journal's biggest advantages — you'll spot patterns you missed while live.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
  </div>
</section>

